---
// AboutIntro Section — KiMi-style dark statement section
---

<section id="about" class="statement-section">
  <div class="statement-inner">
    <p class="statement-quote">
      Precision in every flight. <em>Reliability</em> at every uplift.<br/>
      <strong>Trusted globally.</strong>
    </p>
    <a href="/about" class="statement-link">
      Discover our story
      <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .statement-section {
    background: #000000;
    padding: 10rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .statement-inner {
    max-width: 900px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .statement-quote {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .statement-quote em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
  }

  .statement-quote strong {
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .statement-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .statement-link:hover { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .statement-section { padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
    .statement-quote { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 6vw, 2.5rem); }
  }
</style>
